{"id":"01a03ecc-059d-723e-a2cf-2103458bc2dd","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.7.6.1.2","event_type":"updated","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"{\"id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.7.6.1.2\",\"title\":\"Rust: SenML pack/unpack\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"assignee\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"owner\":\"me@mark.atwood.name\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:44:32.444765Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-26T15:51:39.315164Z\",\"started_at\":\"2026-08-26T14:57:13.74706Z\",\"lease_expires_at\":\"2026-08-26T15:56:39.315164Z\",\"heartbeat_at\":\"2026-08-26T15:51:39.315164Z\",\"dependencies\":[{\"issue_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.7.6.1.2\",\"depends_on_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.7.6.1\",\"type\":\"parent-child\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:44:32.935213Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"metadata\":\"{}\"}]}","new_value":"{\"notes\":\"Implemented complete allocation-free Rust SenML-CBOR pack/unpack without C/Zephyr. Replaced the upstream 8-field Record bottleneck with a source-compatible borrowed local Record covering all RFC 8428 fields: bn/bt/bu/bv/bs/bver/n/u/v/vs/vb/vd/s/t/ut. Encoder prevalidates names, finite numbers, bver 1..=10, and v/vs/vb/vd one-of before any output mutation; supports exact capacity reporting and definite byte strings. Decoder handles typed fields, all integer/float widths, duplicates, unknown numeric labels, optional string extensions, mandatory '_' extension rejection, malformed/trailing/capacity input, and no allocation. cbor compatibility API, Position, and IPSO callers remain green. Added shared senml_full_fields vector/schema with byte-exact Python/Rust encode/decode/re-encode consumers. Green: lichen-senml 21 unit + 15 integration tests, position SenML 4, fmt, all-target clippy -D warnings, no-default-features/no_std; Python parity/location/codec 61, ruff, mypy, both schemas.\"}","created_at":"2026-08-26T15:59:13.309148Z"}
